    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Frequency and sharing",
     "texto": [
      "**Hver dag** means «every day» and **hver uke**, «every week». **Sammen** means «together» and **alene**, «alone».",
      "**Middag** is the main meal of the day; it can be at midday or in the afternoon. It is not always the same as English «dinner» (the evening meal)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
